                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout style="vertical" rend="arris_up-top-down-up">The inscription is on four angles of the pillar. The first line reads up the left-hand arris of the main face, across the top and down the right (boustrophedon fashion). A second line reads upwards on the rear arris, just behind the the beginning of the first line. </layout>
                            </layoutDesc>
