                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote>The ogham strokes were initially <rs type="execution"  key="pocked" ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/11.html">pocked</rs> and possibly subsequently rubbed or otherwise defined. The vowel strokes are almost as long as the consonant strokes, particularly the U of MUCOI at the top of the first angle on the left. <height></height>
                            </handNote>
                        </handDesc>
